# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LIVE GOOGLE REVIEWS (official Google Places API, New)
#
# ONE single Google Business Profile serves both the Agadir and Marrakech
# pages. Until these two values are filled in, /api/google-reviews serves the
# verified static data of that same profile and reports itself as
# "static-fallback". Fill them in, restart the dev server, and both pages
# automatically switch to live synchronized Google reviews.
#
# GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY:
#   Create in Google Cloud Console, enable "Places API (New)" on the project,
#   restrict the key to that API. Server side only, never expose it to the
#   browser.
#
# GOOGLE_PLACE_ID:
#   The Place ID of the Hot Air Balloon Experience Agadir Google Business
#   Profile (the single profile used for both destinations). Find it with the
#   official Place ID finder:
#   https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/places/web-service/place-id
#
# ALREADY RESOLVED: the Place ID below was extracted from the redirect of the
# official review link https://g.page/r/CTpAykunXGoYEAE/review, which lands on
# search.google.com/local/writereview?placeid=ChIJ0SSoolm3sw0ROkDKS6dcahg
GOOGLE_PLACE_ID=ChIJ0SSoolm3sw0ROkDKS6dcahg
#
# The ONLY remaining credential for live synchronization:
# GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
